    "body": "**Outcome:** all validated branches converge on safe authoritative Product/SKU publication with supplier offer linkage.\n\n**Build/Integrate:** single review record shows original supplier row, source file, normalized identity, Brand/Line/Ingredient/routine dependencies and evidence, content/media draft, policy/quality conflicts. Allow correct/approve/reject/request-more with audit; high-confidence normal known-offer updates need no editorial hold, new published products need human approval at launch. Recompute Product fingerprint after enrichment and within transaction before publish; concurrent same candidate/source/aliases cannot create duplicate. Publish through Catalog owner APIs, link supplier offer through Sourcing, keep sell price/listing permission separate and explicit. Review is not permission to turn unknown availability into in-stock.\n\n**Acceptance:** initial two suppliers name same new product → one Product/SKU, supplier-specific offers; missing mandatory identity/official packshot/legal-safety blockers prohibit public listing; rejection persists; partial provider failure resumable; product appears only after real catalog/listing/sellability policy. Link prior [GLO-77](https://linear.app/ahme-hassan/issue/GLO-77/implement-product-candidate-review-and-publish-apis)/124.\n\n**Execution dependency:** blocked by AhmedHassanDev1/shena-care#140. Complete and review previous gate before starting this stage.\n\n### Publish gate clarification: no mandatory AI imagery\n\nRequire appropriate verified identity/source photos and source/trademark/media permissions as policy dictates. Do NOT require ingredient concept illustration, synthetic lifestyle image or paid generative image service; mark optional media NOT_GENERATED and allow editorial approval/publish when real product facts, genuine media and safety checks pass.",
